{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c06da7f8f856fa70ace1645995da7276674f0a6119e4969569e0b10fe4cc8513", "ja": "（茜と奈緒が一緒に作り上げたイベントは大成功！\n準備から長い期間、ふたりともよく頑張ったな）", "zh": "（茜和奈绪共同打造的活动大获成功！从准备阶段开始，持续了这么长时间，你们两个都很努力啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "26eb8d692a1db6a8a3ec87aee3eff57020fb2fd0eb2c3fd702f682ff08893f1a", "ja": "お疲れさま、茜。\nぼーっとして、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，茜。\n发什么呆呢，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "57003a7e8fbeb95d526f2d5c79ee53fdbb8ca5149be0b4b1fcdcd01658c43f9d", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……茜ちゃんは今、\n自らの功績、その余韻に浸っているところなんだよ……", "zh": "{$P$}……小茜现在，\n正沉浸在自己立下的功绩的余韵当中呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "4898781c30a0a1f1c5405e7592f6c21e44e9e3a90f708dfa967f50a85b8b354a", "ja": "今日、みんなすっごく楽しんでたでしょ？\nそれはもう、大成功と言っても過言じゃないぐらいに。", "zh": "今天大家都玩得超开心的，对吧？\n简直可以说是大成功了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "4bcf3c3b9036be9068b68feff4af66a864e66d38a3c01b8f983cff5070aceeed", "ja": "それもこれも、全部茜ちゃんたちの頑張りのおかげ……\nつまり、茜ちゃんなくして成功はなかったんだよ！！", "zh": "这一切全都多亏了小茜他们的努力……也就是说，没有小茜就不可能成功！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6dfefd2665ae79e21d94375252725ceea788f68eecae8dbcc1334506f8ba326b", "ja": "確かに、間違ってはないな。そういえばイベント中、\n奈緒も同じような事を言ってたよ。", "zh": "确实，这话没错。说起来，活动期间\n奈緒也说过类似的话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ea695c630b84e63101f6afa7ff50c81156aa2abaf921cc9282f3a7154a16fdf", "ja": "えっ！？　もしかして……奈緒やんと茜ちゃん、\nどっちのお手柄か、競っちゃう感じなの！？", "zh": "诶！？难道说……要和奈绪亲、小茜比比谁的功劳更大吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "f62115bb179e418b6f383535d4a2b206d6a1dca50210448d3d25b49bfc2133ed", "ja": "さすがの茜ちゃんでも困っちゃうよ！\n奈緒やんと決着をつけなきゃいけないなんて……！", "zh": "就连小茜也会犯难呀！竟然必须和奈绪一决胜负……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fb7e0b25952cfaeb1ff8f37aae0098b437da823f60792e555dc1a92e0d565a03", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……。奈緒は、\n全部茜のおかげだって言ってたんだよ。", "zh": "不是，不是那个意思……奈绪说，这一切都是托茜的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ea0796ba3abed7d48d46a3bfccf5832df81c9df7567195c8ff192605b80856e", "ja": "ニャッ！？　そっち！？", "zh": "喵！？原来是指那个！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8896b26613bc32236c0e482ed07f6b827ddd1f1e9f11eb189b4fc79d43418628", "ja": "ああ。それに、奈緒だけじゃない。\n他の人達も、茜の頑張ってる姿をちゃんと見てる。", "zh": "啊。而且不只是奈绪。\n其他人也都好好看到了茜努力的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6c9ebdc594d2f9a36b5a94519a187d0d713a7d335b5239af95f6b1f729102318", "ja": "もちろん、俺もだ。だから今回、\nふたりのお手柄なのは間違いないよ。", "zh": "当然，我也看在眼里。所以这次，\n毫无疑问是你们两个人的功劳哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "e80e7e79ad5a2a913471d7fadcb2231e486273d7aca75064d57e0e3c91c4a105", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、ストップストップ～！\n褒められすぎて、茜ちゃんはお腹いっぱいです！", "zh": "{$P$}，快停快停～！\n被夸得太狠，小茜都快吃撑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "a10f88dc4d7ef96d653e9185d7e282cca6db043f4ea51884675243fd0435a267", "ja": "さ、さすがの茜ちゃんもこれは……ううっ。\n追い褒め言葉も禁止だよ！", "zh": "就连小茜也顶不住这个……呜呜。\n不许再继续夸了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "877048287cfb0efc761f5645caad3e64f0b083bc554e9e30543e3c549285b8a2", "ja": "でも……そっか。奈緒やん、茜ちゃんの\n知らないところで、そんなこと言ってたんだ。", "zh": "不过……这样啊。奈绪呀，在小茜不知道的时候说过那种话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5e9395abbd48c2e0fe41edacb53ab01ac3ca560d093b36f862ec69f138a1966c", "ja": "あ、今バラした事は奈緒に内緒にしてくれ。\n茜に知られるのは照れ臭いみたいだからな。", "zh": "啊，刚才我说漏嘴的事，帮我瞒着奈绪。她好像觉得被茜知道了会很害臊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "9f807ae69b8581d4603f974de3022139f0c004f13d6784721adb11cca84de90c", "ja": "オッケー♪　もう、奈緒やんってば……。\n遠慮なんかしないで、ドーンと来てくれればいいのに！", "zh": "好嘞♪ 真是的，奈绪酱……不用客气，尽管放马过来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "6fa54e9ac82b0fd2c13ee9ec3a2302367e7f1f694d10329501c110232cfef24e", "ja": "いや、茜ちゃんからぶつかりに行けばいいのか……。\nよし！　ちょっと、奈緒やんのとこに行ってくるね！", "zh": "不对，由小茜直接撞上去不就行了吗……\n好！我去一趟奈绪那边哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "9863316de3b936216cb609de5feffe529fbd892f7a0b5d8d7a39c7406789a638", "ja": "今回のMVPは、奈緒やんと茜ちゃんのふたりだし！\nだから打ち上げ、ちょっと待って～！", "zh": "这次的MVP是奈绪和小茜两个人嘛！所以庆功宴稍微等我一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0284_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b782104d8a0cb1f9e77f64896edd99f582bde601b12a6a42547c50fc667b6c55", "ja": "（一緒に過ごした事で、ふたりの絆は深まったようだ。\n……さて、打ち上げの時間を調整しないとな！）", "zh": "（一起度过这段时光后，两人的羁绊似乎加深了。……好了，得安排一下庆功宴的时间了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
